{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "唯一的行业偶像  (Admiring Her One True Idol)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After hours of shopping and trading lighthearted gossip with Xingtian's chairwoman, Bu Xiaogu opens up honestly about why she gave up everything to follow Chun Yuqiao into television production. Listen to Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "逛街我是能逛，可董事长您今天讲的八卦太劲爆了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "足够让我再重新认识您一次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不知道您给我的这个美誉，我是应该兴奋呢，还是应该悲伤呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，崇拜淳于总这事您都知道了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实实不相瞒，我从念本科的时候就开始觉得淳于总是我的偶像了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一直都是，他是我唯一的偶像。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "进了星天认识他以后，我觉得他跟我想象的不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反而让我觉得他更了不起了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他是除我父母之外，给我影响最深的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，其实这事特别简单，勇气和青春结合到一起就有一个字：傻！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "逛街我是能逛，可董事长您今天讲的八卦太劲爆了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can shop all day, yet the gossip you shared today was truly explosive, Chairwoman.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "足够让我再重新认识您一次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is enough to make me see you in a whole new light.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不知道您给我的这个美誉，我是应该兴奋呢，还是应该悲伤呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With high praise like that from you, should I feel thrilled or tearful?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，崇拜淳于总这事您都知道了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, you even know that I joined Xingtian out of admiration for Mr Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实实不相瞒，我从念本科的时候就开始觉得淳于总是我的偶像了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Truth be told, ever since my undergraduate days I have seen Mr Chun Yuqiao as my idol.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一直都是，他是我唯一的偶像。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He always has been—my one and only idol.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "进了星天认识他以后，我觉得他跟我想象的不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After joining Xingtian and meeting him in person, he turned out different from what I imagined.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反而让我觉得他更了不起了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In fact, it made me find him even more remarkable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他是除我父母之外，给我影响最深的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next to my parents, he is the person who has influenced me most deeply.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，其实这事特别简单，勇气和青春结合到一起就有一个字：傻！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, it is really simple—put courage and youth together and you get one word: foolish!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "逛街我是能逛，可董事长您今天讲的八卦太劲爆了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "足够让我再重新认识您一次了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不知道您给我的这个美誉，我是应该兴奋呢，还是应该悲伤呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，崇拜淳于总这事您都知道了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实实不相瞒，我从念本科的时候就开始觉得淳于总是我的偶像了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一直都是，他是我唯一的偶像。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "进了星天认识他以后，我觉得他跟我想象的不一样。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反而让我觉得他更了不起了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他是除我父母之外，给我影响最深的人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，其实这事特别简单，勇气和青春结合到一起就有一个字：傻！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Charmed by Bu Xiaogu's candid spirit, the chairwoman toasts her youthful courage and keeps chatting on a sunny bench. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
